{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kodoku is a single-player survival horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within an otherworld sealed inside a jar, players must gather \u201cSouls\u201d while hiding from relentless, nightmarish creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Into the Jar-Bound Otherworld</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Urohoshi, a university professor of folklore, journeys deep into the mountains in search of a friend who vanished without a trace\u2014drawn there by a grotesque statue of Kannon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After leaping into a massive jar found at the site, Urohoshi awakens in an otherworld ruled entirely by monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man whose head is fused with a jar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skeleton dragging an enormous ox cart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm dominated by grotesque beings, Urohoshi encounters a solitary young girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFor my sake, gather souls within the jar.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus begins Urohoshi\u2019s journey\u2014to survive, and to return alive to the world of the living\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/a03499e09d43c276319446d05b7fb335.poster.avif?t=1768529721\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/a03499e09d43c276319446d05b7fb335.webm?t=1768529721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/a03499e09d43c276319446d05b7fb335.mp4?t=1768529721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 First-Person Survival Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can slow monsters and abominations, but you cannot defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Press onward through darkness while fighting the terror of being hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Collect Souls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore each stage and gather glowing souls scattered throughout the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once the required number is reached, escape through a torii gate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Master the Jar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The jar you carry can be thrown after collecting enough souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use it to divert enemy attention or activate switches for overhead doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/316aa3ec4c768867de835ad8becfdb35.poster.avif?t=1768529721\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/316aa3ec4c768867de835ad8becfdb35.webm?t=1768529721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/316aa3ec4c768867de835ad8becfdb35.mp4?t=1768529721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0  A World of Beautiful Finality</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The otherworld inside the jar is filled with someone\u2019s regrets and trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blazing wastelands. Bottomless ravines. Temples steeped in hollow splendor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of this solitary journey, what truth awaits Urohoshi\u2015\u2015\uff1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/2d2407bfaeccd0a54764ba78cc9e3c6e.poster.avif?t=1768529721\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/2d2407bfaeccd0a54764ba78cc9e3c6e.webm?t=1768529721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/extras/2d2407bfaeccd0a54764ba78cc9e3c6e.mp4?t=1768529721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864610?t=1768529721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864610?t=1768529721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/436bca86b2c9b569cfb581f3cf5c0e8b2f546076/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768529721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864610/436bca86b2c9b569cfb581f3cf5c0e8b2f546076/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768529721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Violence by monsters against the player"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4270260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kodoku is a single-player survival horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within an otherworld se